cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "miHelper" in publications use:'
type: software
license: MIT
title: 'miHelper: Helper Functions to Combine Multiparameter Multiple Imputation Estimates'
version: 0.1.0
abstract: Helper functions to combine multiparameter multiple imputation estimates
  including a multivariate version of Rubin's rules (Rubin, 1987 <https://doi.org/10.1002/9780470316696>)
  and the adjustment proposed by Li, Raghunathan, and Rubin (1991 <https://doi.org/10.1080/01621459.1991.10475152>).
  Models are fitted on the imputed data sets from 'mice', 'Amelia', or the multivariate
  normal model (EM and data augmentation, Schafer, 1997 <https://doi.org/10.1201/9780367803025>,
  in C++), and the estimates are pooled.
